Welcome to our store to shop
To make the shoes you buy fit your feet, please read our size chart carefully
US 4= EU 34 / CN 34 = foot length 220mm;
US 4.5= EU 35 / CN 35 = foot length 225 mm;
US 5= EU 36 / CN 36 = foot length 230 mm;
US 5.5= EU 37 / CN 37 = foot length 235 mm;
US 6= EU 38 / CN 38 = foot length 240 mm;
US 6.5 =EU 39 / CN 39 = foot length 245 mm;
US 7 = EU 40 / CN 40 = foot length 250 mm;
US 8 = EU 41 / CN 41 = foot length 255 mm;
US 8.5 = EU 42/ CN 42 = foot length 260 mm; US 9.5 = EU 43/ CN 43 = foot length 265 mm; US 10 =  EU 44/ CN 44 = foot length 270 mm;
US 11 = EU 45/ CN 45 = foot length 275 mm;
US 12 = EU 46/ CN 46 = foot length 280 mm;
US 12.5 = EU 47/ CN 47 = foot length 285 mm;
US 13 = EU 48/ CN 48 = foot length 290 mm;
The keys to a perfect pair of boots are:
Comfort: Comfort can reduce the occurrence of water bags and other skin problems
Fashion: A stylish appearance can make you different in any occasion, no matter what kind of clothes you match, it is perfect.
Breathability: Breathability is also important, so the feet can breathe, and the insole is elastic and can absorb sweat
Packaging: In order to prevent the increased transportation cost from causing trouble to you, the goods you received are not packed in the box. This can also save your shipping costs.
Color: If you see a style you like, but don't like the color, you can check it in our store. The product has other colors.
We use professional technology to tailor shoes for you
This is a stylish, comfortable and versatile boot.
We have a professional design team, production technology and material selection.
We will try our best to make our customers 100% satisfied.
Professional team, we design more fashionable shoes for you.
Thank you so much for your five-star review!
Welcome to shop here!
Please pay attention to the store, we will update the latest products for you every day, hope there are products you like.Your recognition is our greatest encouragement.
